# Real ballot-level preference data for the 2012 Orkney Islands Council election, North
# Isles ward (4 candidates, 3 seats). Converted from the CSV preference profile at
# https://github.com/mggg/scot-elex/blob/main/4_cands/orkney_2012_ward6.csv (MGGG's public
# archive of real Scottish STV preference profiles for 2012/2017/2022, described in
# arXiv:2605.12676). Cross-checked against Wikipedia's "North Isles (Orkney ward)" page: 1055
# valid votes, quota 264, first preferences Hagan 433 / Clackson 308 / Skuse 170 / Sinclair
# 144, and Hagan, Clackson, and Sinclair (not Skuse) elected — Sinclair only crosses quota in
# the final round after Skuse's elimination transfers her votes — this file reproduces all of
# that exactly when run with the "scottish" ruleset (Droop quota + WIGM + truncate to 5
# decimal places).
